  <SCWC_WarcasketHelmet_Shipcracker.label>飞船突袭型战棺头盔</SCWC_WarcasketHelmet_Shipcracker.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with improved impact dispersion, sealed and equipped with an onboard respirator and an aiming assist. -->
